config GPIO_STM8
	bool "STM8S GPIO driver"
	default y
	depends on SOC_SERIES_STM8S
	depends on DT_HAS_ST_STM8_GPIO_ENABLED
	help
	  Configure GPIO inputs, outputs and port operations. External interrupts
	  support rising, falling, both edges, and low level. The hardware has
	  no per-pin pending flags, so one interrupt pin is supported per port
	  vector. PD7's unmaskable TLI interrupt is unsupported.
